{"title":"Career roadmap — Equity Research Analyst","role":"Equity Research Analyst","summary":"An Equity Research Analyst studies companies, industries, financial markets, and securities to determine their investment attractiveness. The role involves financial modelling, valuation, earnings analysis, industry research, and producing investment recommendations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Financial Markets"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com graduate, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Financial Analysis","Markets","Financial Modelling","Valuation","Equity Research","Portfolio/Investment Analysis"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Accounting, financial statements, Excel, markets, valuation, financial modelling, research writing"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Sector specialisation, advanced valuation, earnings research, institutional research"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Quantitative research, alternative data, portfolio strategy, AI-assisted research"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-driven investment research, systematic analysis, real-time market intelligence and research leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Finance and accounting foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Balance Sheet"},{"text":"Profit & Loss"},{"text":"Cash Flow Statement"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Capital structure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NSE/BSE market basics"},{"text":"Equity"},{"text":"Bonds"},{"text":"Mutual funds"},{"text":"ETFs"},{"text":"Derivatives fundamentals"},{"text":"Market indices"},{"text":"IPOs"},{"text":"Corporate actions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong Excel skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Financial analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyse a company."},{"type":"h","text":"Fundamental analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue growth"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"EBIT"},{"text":"PAT"},{"text":"EPS"},{"text":"Free cash flow"},{"text":"Margins"},{"text":"ROE"},{"text":"ROCE"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Capital expenditure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ratio analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"P/E"},{"text":"P/B"},{"text":"EV/EBITDA"},{"text":"EV/Sales"},{"text":"ROE"},{"text":"ROCE"},{"text":"Debt/Equity"},{"text":"Interest coverage"},{"text":"Current ratio"},{"text":"Asset turnover"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start reading:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annual reports"},{"text":"Investor presentations"},{"text":"Earnings releases"},{"text":"Conference-call transcripts"},{"text":"Industry reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Equity research specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Financials","Assumptions","Forecast","Valuation","Target Price"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue forecasting"},{"text":"Margin forecasting"},{"text":"Working-capital modelling"},{"text":"Capex"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Free cash flow"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Valuation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Discounted Cash Flow — DCF"},{"text":"Comparable Companies"},{"text":"Precedent Transactions"},{"text":"P/E valuation"},{"text":"EV/EBITDA"},{"text":"EV/Sales"},{"text":"Dividend Discount Model"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What does the company do?"},{"text":"How does it make money?"},{"text":"How large is the market?"},{"text":"What drives growth?"},{"text":"What are the competitive advantages?"},{"text":"What could go wrong?"},{"text":"What is the fair value?"},{"text":"What is the market already pricing in?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Equity research portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Full Equity Research Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Select one listed company."},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Company Overview","Industry","Business Model","Management","Financials","Risks","Valuation","Investment Thesis","Target Price"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bull case"},{"text":"Base case"},{"text":"Bear case"},{"text":"Key catalysts"},{"text":"Key risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Three-Statement Financial Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Income Statement","Balance Sheet","Cash Flow"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"for at least 5 historical years and forecast the next 3–5 years."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sector Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare 5–10 companies within one sector."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Company","Revenue","EBITDA Margin","ROE","Debt","Valuation","Growth"]},{"type":"p","text":"Then identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industry leader"},{"text":"Growth leader"},{"text":"Value opportunity"},{"text":"Highest-risk company"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates actual analyst thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Fundamental Equity