:"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The biggest differentiator is not simply knowing the stock market. A strong Equity Research Analyst can turn financial statements + industry information + valuation + risk analysis into a defensible investment thesis."},{"type":"p","text":"1139 | UG | Commerce | B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce) | B.Com – Financial Markets | Stock Broker Associate"}]}]}